<span class="ltx_personname">Pablo F. Damasceno<sup id="id3" class="ltx_sup"><span id="id3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">†</span></sup>
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
<span class="ltx_contact ltx_role_affiliation"><span class="ltx_contact_name">Affiliation: </span> Janssen R&amp;D, LLC, a Johnson &amp; Johnson Company
</span></span></span></span>
